te":"2025-08-12","form":"8-K","codes":["1.01","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Material agreement entered","kind":"deal","tone":"good"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1854139/000143774925026251/0001437749-25-026251-index.htm"},{"date":"2025-08-06","form":"8-K","codes":["2.02","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Results announced","kind":"results","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1854139/000095017025104033/0000950170-25-104033-index.htm"}],"legal_events":[{"date":"2021-08-05","label":"Activist or control stake disclosed","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1854139/000095014221002562/0000950142-21-002562-index.htm","tone":"warn"}],"summary":{"sentences":["Zevia PBC files with the SEC under \"Bottled & Canned Soft Drinks & Carbonated Waters\", based in CA, and has been publicly reporting for 4 years.","It reported $169.5m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 21.2% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 48.4%.","Listed on NYSE, it funds itself from operations ($4.9m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 21.2% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $46.1m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1854139/000143774926015202/0001437749-26-015202-index.htm","accession":"0001437749-26-015202"},{"text":"Gross margin of 48.4% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1854139/000143774926015202/0001437749-26-015202-index.htm","accession":"0001437749-26-015202"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $4.9m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1854139/000143774926015202/0001437749-26-015202-index.htm","accession":"0001437749-26-015202"},{"text":"Net cash of $26.6m against total assets of $57.9m - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1854139/000143774926015202/0001437749-26-015202-index.htm","accession":"0001437749-26-015202"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-10.8% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1854139/000143774926015202/0001437749-26-015202-index.htm","accession":"0001437749-26-015202"}],"bear":[{"text":"Gross margin compressed from 50.1% to 48.4% against the same quarter a year earlier. Either input costs are rising or the company is discounting to hold volume.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1854139/000143774926015202/0001437749-26-015202-index.htm","accession":"0001437749-26-015202"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-5.1% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1854139/000143774926015202/0001437749-26-015202-index.htm","accession":"0001437749-26-015202"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 3.1% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (225,670 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1854139/000184794426000004/0001847944-26-000004-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 40.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","thresh